    "en": {
      "trackName": "Arrow Watch - Puzzle Escape",
      "description": "Can you release all the arrows without a collision?\n\nArrow Watch - Puzzle Escape is an elegant logic game designed to challenge your mind anytime, anywhere. Experience the full puzzle adventure on your iPhone or right on your wrist with your Apple Watch.\n\nThe concept is simple: each arrow moves in the direction it points. Your goal is to clear them all from the board. But be careful... if two arrows collide, the path is blocked, and you’ll have to rethink your strategy.\n\nKey Features:\n- 100 Unique Levels: A progressive difficulty curve that will keep your brain sharp.\n- Full Apple Watch Support: Play the complete game natively on your watch. Perfect for quick gaming sessions on the go.\n- Minimalist Design: Dynamic visual themes that change with every level for a clean, relaxing experience.\n- Offline Play: No ads, no in-app purchases, and no internet connection required.\n\nDo you have the spatial vision to solve all 100 levels?",
